     "Jupiter leaves your income for your 3rd house on July 26, and conversation, local errands and siblings start to feel lighter. Mars in your 4th house of home from July 15 to September 2 may stir things up at the same time, so keep some patience for whoever shares your kitchen. Then the August 2 eclipse lands in your 2nd house, on the money line. Look at where your income really comes from and whether you are happy with that."
