     "The risk in a public year is that the people closest to you get the leftovers. If you have a partner, you might notice the tired version of you turning up at dinner while the charming one stays at the office. Say so out loud before they do. If you are single, try letting someone meet the off-duty you early on, including the part that needs an evening alone. That is usually the part that keeps people.",
     "Venus warms your 7th house, the part of the chart for serious partners, from February 3 to March 1, a good spell for a proper weekend away from work talk. The full moons of April 21 and May 20 both fall in your 5th house of romance and fun, gentle prompts to do something unserious. Venus in your own sign from July 3 to July 27 tends to make you easier to approach. The liveliest weeks come in autumn: Mars is in your 5th house from September 2 to October 16, and Venus arrives there on October 8, though Mercury's retrograde from October 7 may bring back a name you thought you had filed away. Mars and Venus both enter your 7th house on November 25, and the year ends with love back at the top of the list."
