     "Uranus stays in your 12th house, where you go when you want to be alone, all year, and it can bring sudden wishes to vanish for a day. Let yourself, where you can. The Sun passes through that same house from May 21 to June 21, so the month before your birthday tends to want fewer plans. The Moon's phases may also be worth tracking for a few months, simply to see whether your energy follows any pattern at all."
