     "Mercury backs into that house on February 18 and turns direct on March 3, and Venus spends March 1 to March 26 there. This is a good spell for reopening an honest talk that went badly last time. Venus enters Leo on July 27 and stays until August 20, right across the eclipse, so you may get more attention than usual. Worth asking what you want it for. The lighter side comes in late autumn: Mars is in your 5th house of romance and play from October 16 to November 25, Venus joins it from November 1 to November 25, and those weeks suit flirting, a trip, or a date that has no agenda. Venus enters your 7th house again on December 19, so the year closes with the partner question back on the table, more kindly than it opened."
